OL,3,CMan dies after fall from height in
OL,4,CLake District
OL,6,FA man has died after falling from a
OL,7,Fheight in the Lake District.
OL,9,FKeswick Mountain Rescue Team and
OL,10,Femergency services were called to Moss
OL,11,FForce, Newlands House yesterday
OL,12,Fafternoon, 6 August, to reports a man
OL,13,Fhad slipped and fallen a considerable
OL,14,Fdistance.
OL,16,FVisitors to the waterfall, including
OL,17,Foff duty medical professionals,
OL,18,Fprovided initial support while
OL,19,Femergency services made their way to
OL,20,Fthe scene.
OL,1,W{$~k4{$k4~sjw=                 G1/3
