OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F326A1786358877
OL,3,CMan dies after fall from height in
OL,4,CLake District
OL,6,FThe man, aged in his 70s, died as a
OL,7,Fresult of his injuries.
OL,9,FCumbria Police said in a statement
OL,10,Fthat there were no suspicious
OL,11,Fcircumstances and a file will be
OL,12,Fprepared for the coroner.
OL,14,FTeams from Keswick and Cockermouth
OL,15,FMountain Rescue teams, the Great North
OL,16,FAir Ambulance, North West Ambulance
OL,17,FService and Cumbria Police and Fire
OL,18,Fwere all in attendance.
